---
layout: base.njk
title: "Careers | VidhiCorp Legal Chambers"
description: "VidhiCorp Legal Chambers invites legal professionals and specialists from across disciplines to join as Associate, Senior Associate, Counsel, Partner or Consultant in Gurugram."
permalink: /careers/
---
<section class="page-hero has-photo grain">
  <div class="ph-photo"><img src="/images/hero-protect-poster.jpg" alt="VidhiCorp Legal Chambers, Gurugram — careers and openings" width="1400" height="933" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Careers</p>
    <h1>Join the chambers.</h1>
    <p>We value the effect of collaboration and believe in teamwork, and we're always glad to hear from professionals who share that approach.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="reveal photo-panel" style="aspect-ratio:auto;min-height:420px">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521587760476-6c12a4b040da?w=1000&q=65&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Advocates at work in the chambers" width="1000" height="1250" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <div class="photo-caption">
        <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--brass-300)">Who we're looking for</p>
        <p style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:400;color:var(--paper-50);max-width:34ch">Legal professionals, and specialists across the disciplines that support them.</p>
        <p class="mt-16" style="color:var(--ink-200);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;max-width:44ch">From across the country, on an assignment basis or an ongoing engagement: secretarial, accounting, tax, IT and insurance included.</p>
        <a href="#openings" class="btn btn-outline mt-24" style="border-color:rgba(247,242,232,.5);color:var(--paper-50)">View Openings</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="openings" class="sec-head reveal mt-48">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Current openings</p>
        <h2>Roles the chambers is hiring for.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rows reveal-stagger">
      {% for job in careers %}
      <div class="row-item" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr 100px{% if loop.last %};border-bottom:1px solid var(--border){% endif %}">
        <div>
          <h4 style="font-size:18px">{{ job.role }}</h4>
          <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:4px">{{ job.location }} &middot; {{ job.type }}</p>
        </div>
        <p>{{ job.desc }}</p>
        <span class="pill">{{ job.status }}</span>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-alt">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:760px">
    <div class="sec-head reveal" style="display:block">
      <p class="eyebrow">Interested?</p>
      <h2>Write in with a short note about your background and the kind of work you're looking for.</h2>
    </div>
    <form id="careers-form" class="reveal" novalidate action="https://formspree.io/f/xgaezkod" method="POST" data-ajax data-success-message="Thank you. Your note has been received, and a member of the chambers will be in touch if there's a fit.">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New careers enquiry — VidhiCorp website">
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="field">
          <label for="c-name">Full name *</label>
          <input type="text" id="c-name" name="name" required autocomplete="name">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="c-email">Email address *</label>
          <input type="email" id="c-email" name="email" required autocomplete="email">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="c-phone">Phone number</label>
          <input type="tel" id="c-phone" name="phone" autocomplete="tel">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="c-role">Role you're interested in</label>
          <select id="c-role" name="role">
            <option value="">Select the closest fit (optional)</option>
            {% for job in careers %}<option>{{ job.role }}</option>{% endfor %}
            <option>Other / not sure yet</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="field full">
          <label for="c-message">A short note about your background *</label>
          <textarea id="c-message" name="message" required placeholder="Your experience, current role, and the kind of work you're looking for."></textarea>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary mt-24">Send Note</button>
      <div class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    </form>
    <p class="mt-24" style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-muted);text-align:center">Prefer email? Write to <a href="mailto:{{ site.primaryEmail }}" style="color:var(--accent-strong)">{{ site.primaryEmail }}</a> directly.</p>
  </div>
</section>
